{
  "message": "Thanks — I looked through Rho-Bank’s knowledge base. I could not find any documented referral program for the Crypto-Cash Back Card that matches the $100 / $500 in first 2 months terms in your letter. Because the KB does not show this card as having a published referral offer, I can’t generate or provide the referral-link tool for you.",
  "what_normally_happens": "For cards that do have referral offers, you normally get a unique referral link from the Rho-Bank mobile app or online banking portal, or you can run the user tool get_referral_link(user_id: str, card_name: str) yourself (you must pass your own user_id and the exact card name). Agents must not generate the link on your behalf.",
  "suggested_next_steps": [
    "Check the Referrals / Rewards > Referral Center in your Rho-Bank mobile app or online portal — that’s the fastest way to see and generate active referral links if the offer exists.",
    "If you can, reply here with the exact wording from the mailed offer (quote the key lines). I can re-check the KB for that exact promotion and confirm whether it’s documented.",
    "If you’d like me to escalate and confirm this offer with a human agent, I can transfer you now to a specialist to verify the mailed offer and help get a referral link if available. (If you want that, say “Yes, transfer” and I’ll proceed.)"
  ],
  "ask": "Which would you like to do next?"
}

{
  "message": "I checked Rho-Bank’s knowledge base for the Business Gold Rewards Card. That card’s referral program (the $200 bonus when a referred business spends $7,500 within 90 days) is documented — but the KB also shows the program stopped accepting new referrals after 2025-09-15. Because that window has passed, you won’t be able to generate a new referral link for this offer right now.",
  "details": {
    "program_terms_found": "Earn $200 when a referred business is approved and completes $7,500 in spend within 90 days.",
    "program_timeline": "Accepting new referrals until 2025-09-15 (per KB). Referrals submitted after that date are not eligible."
  },
  "what_you_can_do_next": [
    "Check the Referrals / Rewards > Referral Center in your Rho-Bank mobile app or online portal to confirm current offers (this is the fastest way to see active referral promotions).",
    "If you have another card you want to refer (or the Business Gold offer has been re-launched in your portal), I can: a) search the KB for active referral programs for that card, and b) provide the user tool you can run yourself to generate a link (get_referral_link(user_id: string, card_name: string)).",
    "If you’d like a human to verify whether the mailed offer is still valid or to get an exception, I can transfer you to a specialist — tell me “Yes, transfer” and I’ll proceed."
  ],
  "note_on_referral_link_generation": "When a referral program is active you can generate a unique referral link from the app/portal or by running get_referral_link(user_id, card_name) yourself. Agents are not allowed to generate links on your behalf.",
  "ask": "Which would you like to do next? (Check your app/portal, have me search KB for other active card referral offers, get the referral-tool for you to run, or transfer to a human to confirm your mailed offer?)"
}

{
  "message": "Good news — the Platinum Rewards Card referral offer you described is documented in the knowledge base and is active. The KB shows: $100 referral bonus when the referred friend spends $1,500 within 90 days; up to 7 referral bonuses per calendar year.",
  "how_to_get_your_referral_link": [
    "I’ve provided the user-discoverable tool you can run yourself to generate a referral link: get_referral_link.",
    "To generate a link, run the tool with these arguments:",
    {
      "user_id": "<your_user_id>",
      "card_name": "Platinum Rewards Card"
    },
    "Important: you must run this yourself. Agents are not allowed to generate the link on your behalf."
  ],
  "what_happens_after_running_the_tool": [
    "A referral record will be created with status 'NO_PROGRESS'.",
    "Share the generated link with your referral and make sure they apply using that link so the referral is tracked.",
    "You'll be notified when the referred friend is approved and when they meet the $1,500 spend within 90 days; bonuses are typically credited afterward."
  ],
  "reminders_and_limits": [
    "Self-referrals and duplicate applications do not qualify.",
    "There is a rolling limit: at most 2 credit-card referral bonuses in any rolling 7-day window.",
    "Keep track of your number of referrals to avoid automatic denials."
  ],
  "offer_to_help": "Do you want instructions on how to run the get_referral_link tool (I can show the exact call you need to make), or do you already want to run it now?"
}
